('9.2 Pending fees and payment confirmation',[('03_pending_fees','Figure 9.3: Pending fee selection and calculated display total.'),('04_demo_payment','Figure 9.4: Simulated payment dialog with explicit outcome selection.')],'A selected pending fee appears in the confirmation dialog. The UI identifies the operation as a demo payment. The actual server total is independently calculated from the selected fee rows; the dialog never collects banking details.'),
('9.3 Transaction history and generated receipt',[('05_transaction_history','Figure 9.5: Completed simulated transaction with receipt download.'),('receipt_preview','Figure 9.6: Actual PDF receipt downloaded through the student workflow.')],'The transaction history shows the completed attempt and its receipt link. The downloaded PDF identifies the student and selected fee, totals the line items and states that it is a demonstration receipt. Unsuccessful attempts are retained but do not provide completed-payment receipts.'),
('9.4 Grounded fee assistant outputs',[('06_chatbot_balance','Figure 9.7: Chatbot balance answer retrieved from the student account.'),('07_chatbot_policy','Figure 9.8: Account deadline and maintained policy answers in conversation.')],'The first captured answer reflects the remaining balance after the successful payment. The second view shows a tuition due-date question and a failed-payment policy question. Source labels distinguish account records from policy text.'),
('9.5 Student profile and responsive layout',[('08_student_profile','Figure 9.9: Desktop student profile with the supplied author name and register number.'),('09_mobile_profile','Figure 9.10: Actual 390px-wide mobile profile rendering.')],'The profile uses the project student identity. The mobile screenshot comes from a browser viewport rather than a manually drawn mockup. The capture script checks horizontal overflow on that profile view; a full device and accessibility audit remains future validation.'),
('9.6 Administrator overview and fee allotment',[('10_admin_dashboard','Figure 9.11: Accounts overview after the captured student payment.'),('11_fee_allotment','Figure 9.12: Administrator form filled with an illustrative Project laboratory allocation.')],'The administrator totals include the captured completed payment. The fee allotment screen assigns a new fee to a selected student. Browser verification submitted the displayed Project laboratory allocation and confirmed that the owner could see it.'),
